  "entity": "HCMv3.TravelManagement.TravelFeedback",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A travel expense claim. Claims an employee raises in self-service go to approval: the amount must be above 0, and the employee cannot already have another claim for the trip, unless that one was rejected or sent back. A claim entered here is saved directly. Claims are not paid through payroll.</p>",
